nicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-2d4a48d3774996402b17","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2badfeb40d4b5cdbfbba","layer":"pei","quote":"勋自恃与太祖有宿，日骄慢，数犯法，又诽谤","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":355,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f74a969f7a7c1e39cded","start":86,"end":106,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-318a3b254ed2c9934c00","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-a42173337d0374cee3da","layer":"original","quote":"芝为教与群下曰：“盖君能设教〖3〗，不能使吏必不犯也；吏能犯教，而不能使君必不闻也。夫设教而犯，君之劣也；犯教而闻，吏之祸也。君劣于上，吏祸于下；此政事所以不理也。可不各勉之哉？”于是下吏莫不自励。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-3f52bc72ea8c99af81a9","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b06bc42f5b2724b181a0","layer":"original","quote":"芝不听，与节书曰：“君为大宗〖6〗，加股肱郡〖7〗，而宾客每不与役；既众庶怨望，或流声上闻。今条同等为兵，幸时发遣","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":105,"end":162,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-42324a65c79eb5c15bd1","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-605e96bfce372023c335","layer":"original","quote":"黄初中，入为河南尹；抑强扶弱，私请不行","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-446daea51e813018568d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b06bc42f5b2724b181a0","layer":"original","quote":"顷之，芝差节客王同等为兵〖2〗。掾史据白〖3〗：“节家前后未尝给徭〖4〗，若至时藏匿，必为留负","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":53,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-55db8641226aa070d601","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-d59bc7b679849554479f","layer":"original","quote":"门下循行尝疑门幹盗簪〖4〗，幹辞不符，曹执为狱〖5〗。芝教曰：“凡物有相似而难分者，自非离娄〖6〗，鲜能不惑。就其实然，循行何忍重惜一簪，轻伤同类乎？其寝勿问","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":358,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-5d27ffc173c118b6e9a3","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-1c3a3c4a9387880ee77d","layer":"original","quote":"有盗官练置都厕上者〖12〗，吏疑女工，收以付狱。芝曰：“夫刑罪之失，失在苛暴。今赃物先得而后讯其辞，若不胜掠〖13〗，或至诬服；诬服之情，不可以折狱〖14〗。且简而易从，大人之化也〖15〗；不失有罪〖16〗，庸世之治耳〖17〗。今宥所疑，以隆‘易从’之义，不亦可乎！”太祖从其议","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":9,"end":148,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-6840cd0f069c4b89a451","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-605e96bfce372023c335","layer":"original","quote":"会内官欲以事托芝〖1〗，不敢发言，因芝妻伯父董昭〖2〗；昭犹惮芝，不为通","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":20,"end":56,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-6ecf5b5a369956cfe311","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8496e6806bbbaa59f390","layer":"original","quote":"卞太后遣黄门，诣府传令，芝不通；辄敕洛阳狱，考竟","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":45,"end":69,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-84c80c9a48c238a82ed3","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b06bc42f5b2724b181a0","layer":"original","quote":"太守郝光素敬信芝，即以节代同行，青州号芝“以郡主簿为兵","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":219,"end":246,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-8f83e06f4c7c39c49de2","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b06bc42f5b2724b181a0","layer":"original","quote":"县掾史穷困〖9〗，乞代同行。芝乃驰檄济南〖10〗，具陈节罪","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":189,"end":218,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-9144cb207dc7ac528bb3","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f040e6d57a740c8f49d0","layer":"original","quote":"历甘陵、沛、阳平太守，所在有绩。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":335,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":16,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-937fe301f9953fea1582","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-c61fa13bb81d7bdcbe4d","layer":"original","quote":"以鹿车推载母，居南方十余年，躬耕守节","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":89,"end":107,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-94483a9502acb4580ba7","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8496e6806bbbaa59f390","layer":"original","quote":"而上疏曰：“诸应死罪者，皆当先表，须报〖9〗。前制书禁绝淫祀以正风俗〖10〗。今当等所犯妖刑，辞语始定〖11〗；黄门吴达诣臣，传太皇太后令。臣不敢通，惧有救护速闻圣听；若不得已以垂宿留〖12〗，由事不早竟，是臣之罪。是以冒犯常科，辄敕县考竟。擅行刑戮，伏须诛罚。”帝手报曰：“省表，明卿至心。欲奉诏书，以权行事〖13〗，是也。此乃卿奉诏之意，何谢之有〖14〗？后黄门复往，慎勿通也","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":73,"end":263,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-94955d4d8567f9e0b82e","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-c61fa13bb81d7bdcbe4d","layer":"original","quote":"于鲁阳山遇贼，同行者皆弃老弱走，芝独坐守老母。贼至，以刃临芝；芝叩头曰：“母老，唯在诸君！”贼曰：“此孝子也！杀之不义。”遂得免害","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":331,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-a2fac02b9586639dcee5","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8496e6806bbbaa59f390","layer":"original","quote":"会诸王来朝，与京都人交通〖15〗，坐免","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":292,"end":311,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-bb998b9186119faf818b","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-810acc97b4dae77e02db","layer":"original","quote":"后勋以不轨诛，交关者皆获罪，而芝以见称","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":61,"end":80,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-cec34388e03fb7e33491","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8496e6806bbbaa59f390","layer":"original","quote":"特进曹洪乳母当，与临汾公主侍者，共事无涧神〖7〗，﹝一﹞系狱","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":14,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-cfc4b5dded3f0551780b","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f012aab1df2567d329d6","layer":"original","quote":"卒于官，家无余财","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":381,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":8,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-d0bc48dfc1428371f783","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-810acc97b4dae77e02db","layer":"original","quote":"宾客子弟在界，数犯法。勋与芝书，不著姓名，而多所属托；芝不报其书，一皆如法","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":23,"end":60,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e1b7b0248849ac3c50cd","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-2badfeb40d4b5cdbfbba","layer":"pei","quote":"为李申成所白，收治；并免威官","attribution":"裴注·《魏略》","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":355,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-f74a969f7a7c1e39cded","start":107,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-e2da5cf5bf06e9e9bc4f","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9c6bc5ec36ae12a99fb","layer":"original","quote":"芝奏曰：“王者之治，崇本抑末，务农重谷。《王制》〖4〗：‘无三年之储，国非其国也。’《管子•区言》以积谷为急〖5〗。方今二虏未灭〖6〗，师旅不息；国家之要，惟在谷帛。武皇帝特开屯田之官，专以农桑为业；建安中，天下仓廪充实，百姓殷足。自黄初以来，听诸典农治生，各为部下之计；诚非国家大体所宜也。夫王者以海内为家，故传曰：‘百姓不足，君谁与足〖7〗？’富足之由，在于不失天时而尽地力。今商旅所求，虽有加倍之显利；然于一统之计，已有不赀之损〖8〗，不如垦田益一亩之收也。夫农民之事田，自正月耕种，耘锄条桑〖9〗，耕熯种麦〖10〗，获刈筑场，十月乃毕；治廪系桥〖11〗，运输租赋，除道理梁〖12〗，墐涂室屋〖13〗，以是终岁：无日不为农事也。今诸典农，各言：‘留者为行者宗田计课〖14〗，其力势不得不尔。不有所废，则当素有余力。’臣愚以为：不宜复以商事杂乱，专以农桑为务，于国计为便","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":423,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q-fbbbaea97d38e9ddf740","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-b06bc42f5b2724b181a0","layer":"original","quote":"太祖平荆州，以芝为菅长","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":332,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":11,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-04bae25bd097b2cd36da","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-1c3a3c4a9387880ee77d","layer":"original","quote":"迁大理正〖11〗。有盗官练置都厕上者〖12〗，吏疑女工，收以付狱。芝曰：“夫刑罪之失，失在苛暴。今赃物先得而后讯其辞，若不胜掠〖13〗，或至诬服；诬服之情，不可以折狱〖14〗。且简而易从，大人之化也〖15〗；不失有罪〖16〗，庸世之治耳〖17〗。今宥所疑，以隆‘易从’之义，不亦可乎！”太祖从其议。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":334,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":149,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-1b1ec8589be42e2a9afb","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-f9c6bc5ec36ae12a99fb","layer":"original","quote":"后为大司农。先是，诸典农各部吏民〖1〗，末作治生〖2〗，以要利入〖3〗。芝奏曰：“王者之治，崇本抑末，务农重谷。《王制》〖4〗：‘无三年之储，国非其国也。’《管子•区言》以积谷为急〖5〗。方今二虏未灭〖6〗，师旅不息；国家之要，惟在谷帛。武皇帝特开屯田之官，专以农桑为业；建安中，天下仓廪充实，百姓殷足。自黄初以来，听诸典农治生，各为部下之计；诚非国家大体所宜也。夫王者以海内为家，故传曰：‘百姓不足，君谁与足〖7〗？’富足之由，在于不失天时而尽地力。今商旅所求，虽有加倍之显利；然于一统之计，已有不赀之损〖8〗，不如垦田益一亩之收也。夫农民之事田，自正月耕种，耘锄条桑〖9〗，耕熯种麦〖10〗，获刈筑场，十月乃毕；治廪系桥〖11〗，运输租赋，除道理梁〖12〗，墐涂室屋〖13〗，以是终岁：无日不为农事也。今诸典农，各言：‘留者为行者宗田计课〖14〗，其力势不得不尔。不有所废，则当素有余力。’臣愚以为：不宜复以商事杂乱，专以农桑为务，于国计为便。”明帝从之。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":378,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":430,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-9a2b60294804a0c4d90d","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-810acc97b4dae77e02db","layer":"original","quote":"迁广平令。征虏将军刘勋，贵宠骄豪，又芝故郡将；宾客子弟在界，数犯法。勋与芝书，不著姓名，而多所属托；芝不报其书，一皆如法。后勋以不轨诛，交关者皆获罪，而芝以见称。﹝一﹞","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":333,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":84,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-ed65e2a5d08e2794b5de","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-8496e6806bbbaa59f390","layer":"original","quote":"明帝即位，赐爵关内侯。顷之，特进曹洪乳母当，与临汾公主侍者，共事无涧神〖7〗，﹝一﹞系狱。卞太后遣黄门，诣府传令，芝不通；辄敕洛阳狱，考竟〖8〗，而上疏曰：“诸应死罪者，皆当先表，须报〖9〗。前制书禁绝淫祀以正风俗〖10〗。今当等所犯妖刑，辞语始定〖11〗；黄门吴达诣臣，传太皇太后令。臣不敢通，惧有救护速闻圣听；若不得已以垂宿留〖12〗，由事不早竟，是臣之罪。是以冒犯常科，辄敕县考竟。擅行刑戮，伏须诛罚。”帝手报曰：“省表，明卿至心。欲奉诏书，以权行事〖13〗，是也。此乃卿奉诏之意，何谢之有〖14〗？后黄门复往，慎勿通也！”芝居官十一年，数议科条所不便者。其在公卿间，直道而行。会诸王来朝，与京都人交通〖15〗，坐免。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":359,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":312,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hechang-q-87df477bd5eaf0498e1a","section":"chapter-023","block":"b-fac926ea651795849354","layer":"original","quote":"裴潜字文行，河东闻喜人也〖1〗。﹝一﹞避乱荆州，刘表待以宾礼。潜私谓所亲王粲、司马芝曰〖2〗：“刘牧非霸王之才〖3〗，乃欲西伯自处〖4〗；其败无日矣！”遂南适长沙。","section_title":"和常杨杜赵裴传第二十三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0052.xhtml","index":336,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
